{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DrDhyhcXiqgXqRB5kquPMF","type":"tool_result","content":"== src/index.ts\n// A tiny blog backend. Storage is in memory for now; we want a real database.\ntype Post = { id: number; title: string; content?: string; published: boolean; authorEmail: string };\n\nconst posts: Post[] = [];\n\nexport function addPost(p: Omit<Post, \"id\">): Post {\n  const post = { ...p, id: posts.length + 1 };\n  posts.push(post);\n  return post;\n}\n\nconsole.log(\"notes-api ready\");\n==README\n# notes-api\n\nA small TypeScript blog backend. Run with `npm run dev`.\n==tsconfig\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2023\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"resolveJsonModule\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src\", \"*.ts\"]\n}\n==gitignore\nnode_modules\n.env\n\n==env-keys\nDATABASE_URL=<redacted>\n\na6b5b94 base\n/opt/homebrew/bin/psql\n/opt/homebrew/bin/pg_isready\n/tmp:5432 - accepting connections","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f8245c5-bd37-463f-9199-9ac1f675e622","uuid":"1eecce88-74e7-4ada-b1e3-bc6a9340077b","timestamp":"2026-11-10T02:43:41.665Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"== src/index.ts\n// A tiny blog backend. Storage is in memory for now; we want a real database.\ntype Post = { id: number; title: string; content?: string; published: boolean; authorEmail: string };\n\nconst posts: Post[] = [];\n\nexport function addPost(p: Omit<Post, \"id\">): Post {\n  const post = { ...p, id: posts.length + 1 };\n  posts.push(post);\n  return post;\n}\n\nconsole.log(\"notes-api ready\");\n==README\n# notes-api\n\nA small TypeScript blog backend. Run with `npm run dev`.\n==tsconfig\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2023\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": tr